{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb Down</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling was never more difficult! You've got to work with (and against) gravity to fling yourself past spikes, walls,  scary <i>ORANGE</i> walls, and mysterious <i>BLUE </i>walls. As you keep going down you'll face ever increasing and new challenges. Do you have what it takes?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how fast you can beat each of the four levels, there's always room to improve and with an in game timer there is no setup needed! Test your skills by beating the game on higher difficulties, or chill out with Easy mode.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience heart wrenching struggles and joyous victories on your path to save your green friend from the nefarious and evil<strong><i> RED TRIANGLE</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894120/d01c3301ada3f1e67d5b64c638866ccc58a472c2.jpg"},{"name":"Going Down.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894120/07f5511870c17dbc51c58c27a55592d458670d67.jpg"},{"name":"We Need to go Deeper!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894120/af84758bc2acec3691d4009355302764262ea345.jpg"},{"name":"Is it Getting Hot in Here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894120/45c4565809dcc2c393eeb713dc490fa74a435906.jpg"},{"name":"Falling Down.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894120/a2ef85660370e1b92970e973a1b2642d7a3f5f2b.jpg"},{"name":"We Need to go Faster!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894120/f86803a0ef1e4384c7d9fcbc41df42b7dca1cbe9.jpg"},{"name":"Is it Getting Hasty in Here?","path":"https